-- A STRING input that has to be given and a MAYBE STRING input that need not
-- be, for the cases in batch-blank.csv. The MAYBE input is last on purpose.
@export default describe a code and a note
GIVEN code IS A STRING
      note IS A MAYBE STRING
GIVETH A STRING
describe code note MEANS
  CONSIDER note
    WHEN NOTHING THEN "nothing"
    WHEN JUST s THEN s
